<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Happy Valentine 💖</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff9a9e, #fad0c4);
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      text-align: center;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .card {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      width: 90%;
      max-width: 420px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
      animation: pulse 2s infinite;
    }

    h1 {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .hearts {
      font-size: 22px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    button {
      margin-top: 20px;
      padding: 12px 28px;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 30px;
      background: #ff4d6d;
      color: white;
      font-size: 16px;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    }

    button:hover {
      background: #ff1e4d;
    }

    .message {
      display: none;
      margin-top: 20px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .footer {
      margin-top: 25px;
      font-size: 13px;
      opacity: 0.9;
    }

    @keyframes pulse {
      0% { transform: scale(1); }
      50% { transform: scale(1.05); }
      100% { transform: scale(1); }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="card">
    <h1>Happy Valentine’s Day, LOML ❤️</h1>
    <div class="hearts">💖 💕 💓 💗 💞</div>

    <button onclick="openMessage()">OPEN PLEASE</button>

    <div class="message" id="message">
      Today is Valentine’s Day. I’m here to let you know that I am very grateful for all the things that you did to me,  
      and I hope you know how much I love the way you care about me — listening to all my rants, supporting me,  
      congratulating me, and loving me.

      <br><br>

      I appreciate you for treating me right even though we may fight sometimes.  
      That doesn’t mean I don’t love you anymore.  
      I get mad sometimes because I care about you.

      <br><br>

      Don’t ever think about me leaving you — that’s not who I am.  
      Even if the world is against you, I would still choose to be at your side no matter what happens.

      <br><br>

      <strong>I LOVE YOU SO MUCH BABYYY 💓💓💓</strong>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">Made with love 💕</div>

    <!-- Musik -->
    <audio id="music">
      <source src="bluejeans.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
    </audio>
  </div>

  <script>
    function openMessage() {
      document.getElementById("message").style.display = "block";
      document.getElementById("music").play();
    }
  </script>

</body>
</html>
